Derived from Agent Observatory
------------------------------

This plugin is a standalone extraction of the remote host page of Agent
Observatory (https://github.com/getpaseo/plugins, listed as agent-observatory).
Most of client/ and shared/ is that project's code, used unchanged or with the
server-side halves removed: the session list, the agent detail shell, the
execution digest and its builders, the timeline reader, the UI kit, the status
vocabulary, the attention and decision-signal model, and both message catalogs.

Work that is not Agent Observatory's: the Analysis tab reads a trajectory over
a remote connection and runs its model on the host the screen is on, which
Agent Observatory does not do because its analyses run on the daemon that
recorded the session (client/remote-insights.tsx, client/remote-insight-run.ts,
shared/insight-analysis.ts, shared/insight-runner.ts); and the Sessions row
metric strip (client/row-stats.tsx, shared/row-stats.ts).

